WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.050
These packets of 'happy water' were disguised as imported food boxes,

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.750
shipped by international express delivery.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:17.650
According to the police, 'happy water' is a new kind of drug, only recently brought into Vietnam.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.350
It is extremely toxic and strongly affects the nervous system.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.850
It is a mixture of several different drugs,

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.450
made to increase stimulation and to attract young people.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:40.950
It acts very fast, but its impact on the nervous system is also severe:

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:45.750
within a short time it can cause psychosis, drug shock, and even death.
